     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Jarret<div><br></div><div>That is a nice comparison of methods. </div><div><br></div><div>I have a few comments, for the sem function with lavaan you can include intercepts if you include the argument meanstructure=T for the estimation.</div><div>To have a full comparison, you can add the same model with the R package blavaan, does sem with the lavaan interface and uses JAGS (in the future will use also Stan)</div><div><br></div><div>bye</div><div></div></div>"
    ],
